Data.DatabaseSchemes:
CREATE TABLE Users (
    UserId UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    Email VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    RegistrationDate TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);

CREATE TABLE PageContent (
    ContentId UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    PagePath VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    HtmlContent TEXT NOT NULL,
    LastUpdated TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);

Storage Tech Summary: Relational database (e.g., Azure SQL Database, AWS RDS for PostgreSQL, Google Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL) for structured user and content data, optimized for transactional integrity and query flexibility. Distributed cache (e.g., Azure Cache for Redis, AWS ElastiCache for Redis, Google Cloud Memorystore for Redis) for session data and frequently accessed content to reduce database load.
